{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"4ef275a71ebf79bc54f296643dbb6df8140a32a1e150102937bd4bc91abaa80d","ja":"帰るまでがご参拝！","zh":"回到家才算参拜结束！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"475dfe2a275460e7f4801262c79ae423abd28b49b08c7afb32e56e9f825b3889","ja":"ふぅ～……や、やりました！\n武道館公演祈願、無事に成し遂げましたよ！","zh":"呼～……成、成功了！\n武道馆公演祈愿，顺利达成啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"de532e1a99f7b78c4776b210a418c7c5eb519e1f74c6cd85b8eaa099778bcde9","ja":"ええ……私たち、頑張ったわよね……！\n海美ちゃんも、背中を押してくれてありがと♪","zh":"嗯……我们真的很努力了呢……！\n海美，也谢谢你一直在背后支持我♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5f070d3b27727986246a5ad0080ba62159f9adf5e27e2a548575dbe25ab54f93","ja":"ううん！　こっちこそ、\nふたりとも、一緒にお参りしてくれてありがとっ☆","zh":"没事！倒是我才要说，\n谢谢你们两个人陪我一起来参拜☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"29a49ca9a7b07d756b8c6542d3ed578f699e55655a2ce0819de9229d83148462","ja":"これできっと、武道館公演も大成功だよね！\nそれじゃ、そろそろ帰ろっか☆","zh":"这样一来，武道馆公演也肯定会大成功的吧！\n那差不多该回去了吧☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"8cb6145119496f94ab957dbf997257082effa248f7887be87e8ae62c72512617","ja":"うっ……！　えっと、\n帰りも同じ道を通る……のよね？","zh":"唔……！那个，\n回去也是走同一条路……对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f3d80047b86253f7880307bbae6050c4fcdae69e6100272f755906f505b49e62","ja":"わ、私、もう足が、がくがくしちゃって……。","zh":"我、我的腿已经抖个不停了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"22e4770c6a3b32795213311f7fcfea196210aebc65f2bcb73bff4a18f265ef0e","ja":"私もです……。で、ですがここで止まってたら、\n山で夜を過ごすことになるかも……。","zh":"我也是……。但、但是如果停在这里的话，\n说不定就得在山里过夜了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"5c2b1465304d836b64fd57cc641ff3c39fad84c0072bd87ea1628ea901726dfd","ja":"そうよね……わかったわ、海美ちゃん！\n陽が落ちる前に戻りましょ！","zh":"说得也是……我知道了，海美！\n在太阳落山前回去吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"88217a27df5492bffe83bb68d106001dd0350a9043d0d473e81229bf31f656e4","ja":"それって急いで戻るってことだよね？\nなら、ランニングしながら帰ろうよっ！","zh":"也就是说得赶快回去对吧？\n那我们就跑步回去吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4879e3c964cbb22f226ac976a778810a80fdea55a2c3084c56df42de86531ec2","ja":"へっ！？","zh":"诶！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15","ja":"ええっ！？","zh":"诶诶！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"b9e16f1714e015289d9168d9955562509673a70f9d6e91fd8bc00871eeb80a61","ja":"じゃ、いこっか☆　よ～い……。","zh":"那，我们走吧☆　各就各位～……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"0d1ec748fdc181cd8c6fc79d267693f07dc15158e878be39fb426d2835c4d3fd","ja":"ストーップ！！　海美ちゃん！　下り坂で走るのは\n危ないわよ！　慎重に帰りましょ！","zh":"快停下！！海美！在下坡路跑\n很危险的哦！小心点回去吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1121.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"92c35d6e767da7f411199064e1588e11f3b69a782cf3271c0233b86b9a58145d","ja":"……わ、私、もう一度お参りしていいですか？\n「無事に帰れますように」って……。","zh":"……我、我可以再去参拜一次吗？\n祈愿“能够平平安安地回去”……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
